  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Uttar Pradesh has released the Admit Card for the UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET 2026</span></span>. Online applying process for UP GNM Entrance Exam UPGET Online Form 2026 were accepted from 29 April 2026 to 26 May 2026. The examination is going to be conducted on 16 June 2026. Candidates who applied this form can check their UP GNM Entrance Exam UPGET Admit Card 2026 from the direct link provided below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP GNM Entrance Exam UPGET Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>29 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Last Date : </span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>26 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>26 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<strong>19-26 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date :&nbsp;<strong>16 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <b>10 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <b>13 June 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 3,000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 2,000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through Challan Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 31 December 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>17 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: GNM Course 3 Year</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Conduct</span>&nbsp;</strong>: Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have completed their Class 12<sup>th</sup> level of Examination with English 40% Marks from any recognized board will be eligible for this Examination.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have completed their Class 12<sup>th</sup> level of Examination with English 40% Marks in Vocational ANM Course</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registered ANM with Passing Marks</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Admissions 2026 : Exam District</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Agra, Aligarh, Ayodhya, Azamgarh, bareilly, Basti, Banda, Ghaziabad, Gonda, Gorakhpur, Jhansi, Kanpur, Lucknow Meerut, Mirzapur, Moradabad, Prayagraj (Allahabad), Saharanpur, Varanasi &amp; Gautam Buddha Nagar</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td 